#: main.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Another instance of %1 is already running. Do you really want to open "
"another instance or continue work in the same instance?\n"
"Please note that, unfortunately, duplicate views are read-only."
msgstr ""
"Jiny proces %1 je ju w ùżëcym. Czë richtich chcesz òtemknąc nowi proces czë "
"robic dali na tim co ju je?\n"
"Bôczë, że dëbeltné òtemknłi dokùmentë są blós do òdczëtu."

