#: main.cpp:119
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final D-Bus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgstr ""
"Apartné miono dlô reprezentacëji tegò zbiérkù załóżków, zwëkòwò miono "
"kinstance.\n"
"To bë miało bëc \"konqueror\" dlô załóżków Konquerora, \"kfile\" dlô "
"\"załóżków KFileDialog, ëtd.\n"
"Kùńcowô stegna òbiektów DBus to /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"

